WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:23.220
The sky is still unbroken
The road is dark and long

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:30.600
I have prayed into the silence
And waited for the dawn

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:37.620
But somewhere in the darkness
Morning had begun

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:46.880
Before I ever saw the light
You were there; Father, Spirit, Son.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:55.920
I don’t need the horizon
To tell me You are near

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:03.020
I don’t need the answer
To know that You are here

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:10.500
You were there before the morning
Before the light ever broke through

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:17.340
Before I saw the answer
I was held by You

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:24.020
You were there before the morning
Faithful through the night

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:33.600
I will sing before I see it
I will trust You for the light

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:47.660
If I rise on the wings of the dawn,

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:55.560
If I settle by the farthest sea,
Even there, Your hand guides me,

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:01.560
Holding me for eternity.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:15.080
The shadows lose their edges

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:39.300
The darkness turns to blue
And looking back I finally see

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:46.440
You carried me straight through
In the midnight of the prison,

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:54.080
Paul and Silas raised a song,
They praised You in the darkness,

00:02:54.080 --> 00:03:00.500
And their faith held strong.
You were moving in the silence

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:08.140
You were working while I prayed
The morning did not make You faithful

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:14.620
It only showed the way
I don’t need the horizon

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:21.260
To tell me You are near
I don’t need the answer

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:29.000
To know that You are here
You were there before the morning

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:35.540
Before the light broke through
Before I saw the answer

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:43.500
I was already held by You
You were there before the morning

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:49.860
Faithful through the night
I will sing before I see it

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:55.860
I will trust You for the light

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:12.900
Before the answer
Before the change

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:19.380
Before the sunlight calls my name

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:23.300
You are here
Before I see

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:28.580
Before I know
Before the morning starts to glow

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:36.320
I will sing
I will sing before I see

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:47.220
I will sing before I see

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:54.160
You are here

00:04:54.160 --> 00:05:03.160
You are here
Somewhere in the darkness

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:11.020
Morning had begun
You were there before the morning

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:17.560
Before the light broke through
Before I saw the answer

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:25.520
I was already held by You
You were there before the morning

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:31.840
Faithful through the night
I will sing before I see it

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:40.520
I will trust You for the light
You were there

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:47.520
You were there
Before the morning

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:52.040
You were there
You were there

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:58.160
Through the night
I will sing

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:07.860
Before I see
Jesus, You are here with me

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:15.320
Somewhere in the darkness

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:21.320
Morning had begun
